# tests/std-files, as an ENTRY (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): evaluating this
# directory yields the test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A std/go WORKER test of the file tools. Each `--<tool>:@=DEEP-DEPS/<tool>` is
# the BUILT tool image (naming a dependency evaluates it), run over HTTP the way
# an agent runs a tool: `base:hash=<image>` and `in:hash=<tree>`.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --read:@=DEEP-DEPS/read --ls:@=DEEP-DEPS/ls --write:@=DEEP-DEPS/write --edit:@=DEEP-DEPS/edit --copy:@=DEEP-DEPS/copy --move:@=DEEP-DEPS/move --remove:@=DEEP-DEPS/remove
